        "Tweets are selected through multiple rounds of crowdsourced annotations.",
        "In the first round (R1), 2,400 tweets from the top 80th percentile of confidence scores in the positive class are chosen.",
        "Type-1 tweets are automatically classified as positive but may not be job-related.",
        "In the second round (R2), 800 tweets with confidence scores closest to zero from the positive side and 800 from the negative side are selected.",
        "In the fourth round (R4), about 2,000 tweets labeled as positive by INLINEFORM1 and never used before are chosen."
